      "Rubric: openness in hardware",
      "Motion ｜ Vote",
      "Add after line 3 in Tier 1 and line 3 in Tier 2:",
      "\"Products in military, surveillance and counter-surveillance applications are not eligible for this tier.\"",
      "Increase tax brackets from",
      "0 / 6 / 12 / 18 / 24",
      "to",
      "0 / 10 / 20 / 26 / 32",
      "Change line 4 in Tier 4 and line 4 in Tier 5, from:",
      "\"Use of hardware means to prevent third-party repair.\"",
      "To:",
      "\"Use of hardware or software means to prevent third-party repair.\""
    ],
    "lines_zh": [
      "评分细则：硬件开放性",
      "动议 ｜ 投票",
      "在第 1 级第 3 行和第 2 级第 3 行之后添加：",
      "“用于军事、监控及反监控用途的产品不得列入此等级。”",
      "将税档从",
      "0 / 6 / 12 / 18 / 24",
      "提高至",
      "0 / 10 / 20 / 26 / 32",
      "将第 4 级第 4 行和第 5 级第 4 行，从：",
      "“使用硬件手段阻止第三方维修。”",
      "改为：",
      "“使用硬件或软件手段阻止第三方维修。”"
